  "releaseNotes": "修复质量评分失真：同一规则重复命中改为递减计分并单规则封顶 2×，避免 6 条 ALTER 静态提示把质量分打到 0；修正等级封顶方向，低分不再被反向抬成 C；SQL020/SQL021 降为提示级，重新标定后样例迁移质量分 0→80、等级 C→B。保留 v0.1.31 的最佳实践能力：62 条规则化条目按 MySQL/PostgreSQL/SQL Server/SQLite 方言组织，新标签页与评审联动推荐，新增只读 MCP 工具 sql_best_practices。全程不连接数据库、不执行 SQL、不发起网络请求。",
  "localizations": {
    "en": {
      "name": "SQL Review",
      "description": "Static SQL review workbench: rule-based checks for destructive changes, migration hygiene, performance and schema quality, plus a dialect-aware best-practice catalog surfaced during review. Never connects to a database and never executes the SQL under review."
    },
    "zh-CN": {
